{"id": "97110013", "name": "קירוב לינארי של שורש שלישי – ∛N ליד חזקה שלישית שלמה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>השתמשו בקירוב הלינארי של הפונקציה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=\\sqrt[3]{x}\\)</span> בנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0\\)</span> שהיא החזקה השלישית השלמה הקרובה ביותר ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span>, כדי לקרב את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\sqrt[3]{ {{CT:0}} }\\)</span>. רשמו את הקירוב כשבר מדויק (בלי מחשבון).</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\sqrt[3]{ {{CT:0}} }\\approx\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בוחרים נקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0\\)</span> קרובה ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</span> שבה השורש השלישי ידוע, ומשתמשים בקירוב הלינארי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)\\approx f(x_0)+f'(x_0)(x-x_0)\\)</span> (סעיף 6.9).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנקודה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x_0={{CT:1}}={{CT:2}}^3\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x_0)={{CT:2}}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x-x_0={{CT:0}}-{{CT:1}}={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — הנגזרת בנקודה</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=x^{1/3}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(x)=\\frac{1}{3}x^{-2/3}=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}}\\)</span>. בנקודה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'({{CT:1}})=\\frac{1}{3\\cdot {{CT:2}}^2}={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — הקירוב</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sqrt[3]{ {{CT:0}} }\\approx {{CT:2}}+{{CT:4}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "k+dd/(3*k)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{x}\\right)'=\\frac{1}{3}x^{-2/3}=\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x^2}}\\)</span>, ולא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt[3]{x}}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "k+dd/(2*k)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p>זו הנגזרת של שורש ריבועי. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f(x)=x^{1/3}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(f'(x)=\\frac{1}{3}x^{-2/3}\\)</span>.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["N", "dd", "k", "ta"], "nvariants": 40}